 "description": "<p>The egg attachment is the difference between this and the standard tongue rose: a pair of vibrating eggs rides along with the flicking tongue head, so external licking and internal vibration happen in the same moment instead of trading off. Ten combined licking-and-vibration modes govern the pair.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckerpurple_8_480x480.jpg?v=1690252064\"></p>\n<p>The tongue itself is the soft, stretchy kind — medical-grade silicone with enough flex to bend against the body instead of pressing bluntly — and the rose housing doubles as a handle that stays comfortable through long sessions.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckerpurple_2_84fc6d8f-485e-4b6d-a86f-44903166c184_480x480.jpg?v=1690252049\"></p>\n<p>Between the flower design and the gift-box presentation the listing mentions, it reads as the rare pleasure product that looks intentional on a nightstand rather than hidden. IPX7 waterproofing makes bath play and cleaning equally casual.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckerpurple_3_5a01710c-4c70-4e79-9965-7ea51ff6f453_480x480.jpg?v=1690252052\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Design: tongue head plus dual vibrating eggs</li>\n<li>Modes: 10 combined licking and vibration</li>\n<li>Material: soft medical-grade silicone + ABS</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX7</li>\n<li>Presentation: rose design, gift-boxed</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckerpurple_1_3d78e832-26e1-4569-9282-7259d3cc3861_480x480.jpg?v=1690252046\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckerpurple_4_480x480.jpg?v=1690252056\"></p>\n<p>Licking and internal vibration on one stem — and a gift box to hand it over in.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Rose tongue vibrator with dual vibrating eggs, 10 combined modes, soft medical silicone and IPX7 waterproof gift-boxed design.</p>\n",
